{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "OidcDeveloperRequest, the administrators' queue of pending developer requests",
    "(docs/identity_provider_platform_PRD.md D2), shipped by MintPlayer.Spark.IdentityProvider. A virtual",
    "row type: no clrType; its rows are users whose Developer.Status is Requested, projected per request by",
    "Custom.DeveloperRequests (OidcDeveloperRequestActions). Only Query is granted, never Read: the rows have",
    "no detail page. ApproveDeveloper and RejectDeveloper are its row actions.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. The ids are UUIDv5 of 'identity-provider:OidcDeveloperRequest[.attributes|queries.<Name>]',",
    "written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids -- libs/identity_provider/MintPlayer.Spark.IdentityProvider'."
  ],
